    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Shea O'Toole are pleased to present 2 Glen Terrace to the market, a dormer-style house extending to approximately 900 sq.ft (84 sq.m) over 2 floors.\n\nThe property is located in a quiet residential cul de sac within a short walk of a wide range of amenities, including a supermarket, schools, bus services, the train station and Waterford City Centre.\n\nAccommodation comprises an entrance porch, an open-plan living room, a kitchen and a bathroom at ground floor level, with 3 bedrooms at first floor level. The house has gas-fired central heating and is in reasonable condition throughout. There is a small yard to the rear.\n\nThe property will suit a range of buyers, including first-time purchasers, those looking to trade down and investors seeking a well-located home close to the city centre.\n\n \n\nAccommodation\n\nGround Floor\n\nEntrance Porch 1.14m x 0.99m (3'9 x 3'3)\n\nLiving Room 5.38m x 5.23m (17'8 x 17'2). Open plan, laminate floor, fireplace with timber surround and electric stove insert, built-in shelving, recessed spotlights, understairs storage, stairs to first floor.\n\nKitchen 3.02m x 2.46m (9'11 x 8'1). Fitted floor and wall units, stainless steel sink unit, electric cooker, tiled splashback, tiled floor, door to rear yard.\n\nBathroom 3.00m x 1.42m (9'10 x 4'8). Bath with electric shower, WC, wash hand basin.\n\nFirst Floor\n\nLanding 0.91m x 3.94m (3'0 x 12'11)\n\nBedroom 1 3.38m x 4.17m (11'1 x 13'8). Laminate floor.\n\nBedroom 2 4.24m x 2.59m (13'11 x 8'6). Built-in wardrobes and shelving, laminate floor.\n\nBedroom 3 4.24m x 1.60m (13'11 x 5'3). Laminate floor.\n\n \n\nOutside\nVery small rear yard.\n\n \n\nFeatures\n\nDormer-style home of approx. 900 sq.ft\n\n3 bedrooms\n\nGas-fired central heating\n\nOpen-plan living room\n\nQuiet cul de sac location\n\nShort walk to Waterford City Centre\n\n \n\nViewing: Strictly by appointment with the sole agents.\n\n"
      },
